;Modified - 06/01/2006, 01.01    
;Maximus Decim modified - 06/14/2006, 01.02    
;Maximus Decim modified - 08/31/2006, 01.03    add iPod, fix Sony Digital Camera
;Maximus Decim modified - 09/02/2006, 01.04    add LayoutFile
;Maximus Decim modified - 25/01/2007, 01.05    add wdmstub, remove USB FDD, add CnMemory
;Maximus Decim modified - 07/03/2007, 01.06    remove wdmstub, CnMemore replace Skymedi
;Maximus Decim modified - 28/10/2007, 01.07    add USB FDD (for DISKTSD.VXD 4.90.3001)
;Maximus Decim modified - 12/11/2007, 01.08    add EKE USB FDD (VID_049f&PID_0054),
;                                              add USBCompliance (for usbu2a.sys)
;Maximus Decim modified - 20/11/2007, 01.09    define new USB storage class,
;                                              add Citizen USB FDD (= IOMEGA USB FDD)
;dencorso modified - 19/12/2009, 01.09dc       add Samsung Digimax 220 camera and an 
;                                              commented-out alternative entry for wdmstub.sys
;Maximus Decim modified - 22/12/2009, 01.10    add USBSTOR_CBI_NR devices
;dencorso modified - 14/06/2010, 01.10dc       add Yoo Move 1802TS MP3 Player (thanks to diskless) 
;diskless modified - 14/06/2010, 01.10ds       sort once more by VIDs	
;dencorso modified - 12/09/2010, 01.10dp       add JMicron USB Hard Drive (thanks to piikea)
;dencorso modified - 24/10/2010, 01.10dt       add EMTEC and Kingston problem pen drives...
;Problemchyld modified - 21/05/2012, 01.11     add Sweex 16-in-1 card reader,
                                               Sony PSP, Myson-Century, Cypress Semiconductor, 
                                               Casio Digital Camera, IOMagic Multicard Reader, 
                                               Realtek USB 2.0 Card Reader
;Maximus Decim modified - 31/05/2012, 01.11a   fix for NUSB 3.6

